    "Source and external-runtime identity collection occurs after every reported latency and RSS checkpoint; it does not contaminate measured import or routing memory.",
    "The runtime-input digest includes all src/ and skills/ files, package.json, and bun.lock; the verifier rebuilds it from the pinned Git commit and checks the current branch.",
